Table full name: bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.projects
Column name: id Type: INT64 Description: The unique primary key of the project in the Libraries.io database.
Column name: platform Type: STRING Description: The name of the Package manager the project is available on.
Column name: name Type: STRING Description: The name of the project, unique by Platform (case sensitive).
Column name: created_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The timestamp of when Libraries.io first discovered the project.
Column name: updated_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: The timestamp of when Libraries.io last saved a change to the project.
Column name: description Type: STRING Description: Description provided by the package manager, falling back to description from repository if empty.
Column name: keywords Type: STRING Description: Comma separated array of keywords if supported by package manager.
Column name: homepage_url Type: STRING Description: URL of webpage or repository as provided by package managers that support it.
Column name: licenses Type: STRING Description: Comma separated array of SPDX identifiers for licenses declared in package manager meta data or submitted manually by Libraries.io user via "project suggection" feature.
Column name: repository_url Type: STRING Description: URL of source code repository declared in package manager metadata or submitted manually by Libraries.io user via "project suggection" feature.
Column name: versions_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of published versions of the project found by Libraries.io.
Column name: sourcerank Type: INT64 Description: Libraries.io defined score based on quality, popularity and community metrics.
Column name: latest_release_publish_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Time of the latest release detected by Libraries.io (ordered by semver, falling back to publish date for invalid semver).
Column name: latest_release_number Type: STRING Description: Version number of the latest release detected by Libraries.io (ordered by semver, falling back to publish date for invalid semver).
Column name: package_manager_id Type: INT64 Description: Unique ID of project from package manager API, only currently used by PlatformIO.
Column name: dependent_projects_count Type: INT64 Description: Number of other projects that declare the project as a dependency in one or more of their versions.
Column name: language Type: STRING Description: Primary programming language the project is written in, pulled from the repository if source is hosted on GitHub.
Column name: status Type: STRING Description: Either Active, Deprecated, Unmaintained, Help Wanted, Removed, no value also means active. Updated when detected by Libraries.io or submitted manually by Libraries.io user via "project suggection" feature.
Column name: last_synced_timestamp Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp of when Libraries.io last synced the project from it's package manager API.
Column name: dependent_repositories_count Type: INT64 Description: The total count of open source repositories that list the project as a dependency as detected by Libraries.io.
Column name: repository_id Type: INT64 Description: The unique primary key of the repository for this project in the Libraries.io database.
